# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# This is a correctness requirement, not a style preference. Engine hashes file
# contents for the source fingerprint and the dependency-integrity manifest, so
# a CRLF checkout on a Windows/WSL2 machine would produce different digests for
# the same revision. Keeping LF everywhere makes a digest recorded on one
# platform reproducible on another.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Captured and binary artifacts are never normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
